@startuml
title Local full prototype deployment
node "Guest device" {
 artifact "Telegram client" as Guest
}
cloud "Telegram Bot API" as Telegram
node "Staff device" {
 artifact "Web browser" as Browser
}
node "Single application host" {
 node "Bot process" {
 artifact "Python / aiogram" as Bot
 }
 node "Web process" {
 artifact "Python / FastAPI" as API
 }
 database "Shared SQLite file" as DB
 artifact "Manual export CLI" as Export
}
cloud "Google Sheets (optional)" as Sheets
Guest --> Telegram
Bot --> Telegram : polling / replies
Browser --> API : local HTTP demo; HTTPS for private deployment
Bot --> DB
API --> DB
Export --> DB
Export --> Sheets
note bottom of DB : One host / one shared database path.
Not a multi-instance deployment.
@enduml
